{"chapter":{"blocks":[{"text":"练习","type":"TITLE"},{"text":"本节学习：练习。讲义保留原有示例与练习，可结合正文向教师提问。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"1. 用 NumPy 手写一个两层 MLP 解决 MNIST 手写数字分类。\n2. 对比 SGD 和 Adam 在同一任务上的收敛速度。\n3. 画一个 3×3 卷积核对 5×5 输入的输出，手算验证。\n4. 解释为什么 ResNet 的残差连接能训练 100 层网络。\n5. 用 Hugging Face 跑一个情感分析 pipeline，观察输出。","type":"MARKDOWN"}],"grade_max":12,"grade_min":10,"knowledge_points":[{"description":"学习并解释「练习」中的核心概念与示例。","name":"练习","slug":"senior-deep-learning-topic-18","topic":"计算机与人工智能"}],"license_code":"UNKNOWN","objectives":["解释「练习」的主要概念，并结合示例完成文中练习。"],"order_index":36,"revision":1,"slug":"ch-018-main","source":{"conversion":"supplied-markdown-v1","original_sha256":"060459597f7d47343ad7b47c43e2f7c165bbe51aaaf981165b34d373d765b74f","source_commit":null,"source_path":"sources/060459597f7d4734/03-动手学深度学习.md"},"stage":"SENIOR","title":"练习"},"content_hash":"f1296a27af25b7c07ef90a4c646afc673c7dfbfb4fa5e01b9cbd0d5c4ee5b80d","course":{"slug":"senior-deep-learning","title":"动手学深度学习","topic":"计算机与人工智能"},"is_test_fixture":false,"manifest_hash":"b2500e5121455aa9339fe6399902e89a0917eaf9bd814708a6dc69af397b6b20","release_key":"computing-ai-md-v1-db6ffb6b663b","schema_version":"k12.content.revision-snapshot.v1","source_kind":"NEW_SOURCE"}
